  "goodToKnow": "Das Subjekt is the grammatical subject, in the nominative: Der Hund (Subjekt) beißt den Mann. In philosophy, it's the thinking subject. Pejoratively, ein Subjekt is a dubious individual: ein übles Subjekt. Careful: a school subject is das Fach, and a topic is das Thema. Subjektiv means subjective. Stressed on the second syllable. Plural: die Subjekte."
